acts from operational hygiene.","limitations":["No full system-update transaction was executed; protection was instead demonstrated directly through DNF dependency visibility with the versionlock enabled versus disabled.","Lifecycle snapshots do not inventory installed packages or the versionlock file, so those final-state conclusions rely on the executor's direct command evidence."]}
